{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Tribe Quest</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > is a roguelite action adventure about survival, revenge, and rebuilding.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your village was destroyed by an evil warlord. Take on dangerous quests made up of multiple levels, then return to your permanent village to rebuild, upgrade, and prepare for the next expedition. Each run makes your tribe stronger as you hunt down the one responsible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2458280/extras/5b11c9a24b342d38202adcd7f93abb45.poster.avif?t=1771238528\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2458280/extras/5b11c9a24b342d38202adcd7f93abb45.webm?t=1771238528\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2458280/extras/5b11c9a24b342d38202adcd7f93abb45.mp4?t=1771238528\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Travel, Gather and Craft!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore forests, deserts, mountains, swamps, and dark caves. Gather resources and craft weapons, armor and tools needed to survive the dangers ahead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2458280/extras/19bfb71e5a19dcbaa85ecf28896406fc.poster.avif?t=1771238528\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2458280/extras/19bfb71e5a19dcbaa85ecf28896406fc.webm?t=1771238528\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2458280/extras/19bfb71e5a19dcbaa85ecf28896406fc.mp4?t=1771238528\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2458280/extras/5c40c8eb605afdf37af46b05c0d23423.poster.avif?t=1771238528\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2458280/extras/5c40c8eb605afdf37af46b05c0d23423.webm?t=1771238528\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2458280/extras/5c40c8eb605afdf37af46b05c0d23423.mp4?t=1771238528\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Hunt for food!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hunt and cook to keep your tribe alive. Starvation will weaken your team and put the entire quest at risk.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2458280/extras/c7ec98962b5d3ac65074d64d60f4fe97.poster.avif?t=1771238528\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2458280/extras/c7ec98962b5d3ac65074d64d60f4fe97.webm?t=1771238528\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2458280/extras/c7ec98962b5d3ac65074d64d60f4fe97.mp4?t=1771238528\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Swap characters and give commands!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control your entire team by swapping characters and issuing commands like attack, forage, mine, or guard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2458280/extras/05da4dc7dee5a431c3d113758abb5485.poster.avif?t=1771238528\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2458280/extras/05da4dc7dee5a431c3d113758abb5485.webm?t=1771238528\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2458280/extras/05da4dc7dee5a431c3d113758abb5485.mp4?t=1771238528\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fight monsters!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight a wide variety of dangerous creatures and hostile enemies lurking across the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2458280/extras/8fc2a40e91d2b5b39741049d9ef9b6f9.poster.avif?t=1771238528\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2458280/extras/8fc2a40e91d2b5b39741049d9ef9b6f9.webm?t=1771238528\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2458280/extras/8fc2a40e91d2b5b39741049d9ef9b6f9.mp4?t=1771238528\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2458280/extras/7fcd326037d3ed744ff6f4a2d92543be.poster.avif?t=1771238528\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2458280/extras/7fcd326037d3ed744ff6f4a2d92543be.webm?t=1771238528\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2458280/extras/7fcd326037d3ed744ff6f4a2d92543be.mp4?t=1771238528\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><